c:["$","section",null,{"className":"lg-card overflow-hidden rounded-ios-3xl p-5 sm:rounded-ios-4xl sm:p-7","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-8","children":[["$","section",null,{"id":"codebase","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"01"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"源码目录导览"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"解压后根目录的关键部分："}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"deepseek-harness/\n├─ apps/\n│  ├─ cli/        dsh 命令入口（src/args.ts 命令语法，src/bin.ts 加载运行器）\n│  └─ web/        浏览器 Web 前端源码（Vite 构建）\n├─ packages/      核心包（全部是插件，见下）\n│  ├─ bundle/     base / web-app / headless 三个组合包 = profile 模板\n│  ├─ llm/        LLM 适配器（llm-deepseek、llm-pi-ai 等）\n│  ├─ core/       会话日志、工具注册、agent 循环、作用域\n│  ├─ sandbox/    进程沙箱（read-only / workspace-write / danger-full-access）\n│  ├─ credentials/  凭据存储（.credentials.yaml，只写）\n│  ├─ settings/   设置文档与解析\n│  ├─ shell/      命令执行 seam\n│  ├─ subagent/   子代理提供方\n│  └─ tool-*/     面向模型的工具包（bash、fs、search、terminal、web…）\n├─ native/        Landlock（Linux）沙箱原生实现\n├─ examples/      acp-agent / headless-agent / jsonrpc-agent / mcp-memory 等示例\n└─ docs/          官方文档（user/guide 有中文版）"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["最重要的设计事实：",["$","strong",null,{"children":"产品的每一部分都是插件"}],"——模型适配器、工具注册、会话日志、 Agent 循环本身全部是插件，可以被配置替换，不存在需要打补丁的特权内核。这也是为什么",["$","strong",null,{"children":"改配置就能改行为"}],"，不一定需要改源码。命令语法在"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"apps/cli/src/args.ts"}],"，运行器加载在 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"apps/cli/src/bin.ts"}],"； 组合包模板在 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"packages/bundle/"}],"。"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["三个组合包：",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-base"}],"（每个 profile 的第一层：模型、工具、持久化、沙箱、权限、设置、凭据、遥测）、",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app"}],"（加浏览器应用）、",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-headless"}],"（一次性运行器，无服务器）。"]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"config","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"02"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"配置体系：profile / bundle / patch"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["运行中的 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"dsh"}]," 是一棵插件树，由启动时按序叠加的配置层组成。理解这套 层叠是定制 Harness 的钥匙："]}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":"$L10"}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]]}],"