16:["$","p",null,{"children":["默认是 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"~/.dsh"}],"（可用 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"DSH_HOME"}]," 改路径），里面："]}]
17:["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"~/.dsh/\n├─ settings.yaml           设置文档（模型模态、通用设置等）\n├─ .credentials.yaml       凭据（只写：保存后只回脱敏描述符，永不返回明文）\n├─ cordis.patch.yml        home 级 patch 层（所有 profile 共享）\n└─ profiles/\n   ├─ web/                  web profile（package.json + dsh.profile + cordis.patch.yml）\n   ├─ headless/             headless profile\n   └─ node_modules/         dsh 维护的符号链接后备目录"}]}]
18:["$","p",null,{"children":["提供方凭据按顺序解析：继承的环境变量 → ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"$$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml"}],"→ 调用目录的 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":".env"}]," → ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"$$DSH_HOME/.env"}],"。 凭据由受管文档保存，不会物化进 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"process.env"}],"。"]}]
19:["$","section",null,{"id":"cli","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"03"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"CLI 命令全集"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":[["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"dsh web                                   # 启动 Web UI（--profile web 的别名）\ndsh web --port 8080                       # Web 应用参数：端口\ndsh web --host 127.0.0.1  --trusted-host x --trusted-host y\ndsh web --help                            # 显示 Web 应用的帮助（不启动）\ndsh --profile headless \"run the tests\"    # 一次性任务：跑完打印结果退出\ndsh --profile headless --dump-config      # 只查配置不启动\ndsh plugin --profile tui add <package>    # 给 profile 装插件（转发给 pnpm）\ndsh plugin --profile tui remove <package>\ndsh --help                                # 启动器自己的帮助"}]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"启动器 flag 必须写在最前面"}],"：启动器只解析自己的 flag，第一个无法识别的 token 之后的内容原样交给应用。所以 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"--port"}]," 属于 web 应用。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"headless 一次性任务"}],"：创建全新持久化会话 → 提交任务 → 等待完全停稳并 flush → 打印最终回答。原因为 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"completed"}]," 时退出码 0，否则 1。 它不开服务器、不占用端口。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"--host 0.0.0.0 会被拒绝"}],"：CLI 有意不支持绑定所有网卡，防止局域网暴露。 要开 LAN 访问请用可重复的 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"--trusted-host"}]," 声明可信主机名。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"关闭行为"}],"：SIGTERM 优雅退出（退出码 0）；第一次 Ctrl+C 报告 130； 第二次立即强制退出。"]}]]}]]}]]}]
1a:["$","section",null,{"id":"models","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"04"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"模型路由与提供商"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"pt-2 text-ios-body font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"DeepSeek 官方"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["设置 → 模型 → DeepSeek 卡片填入 API Key 保存即可，模型路由立即可用、无需重启。密钥只写： 保存后界面永不回显，存储在 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"$$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml"}],"。"]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"pt-2 text-ios-body font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"目录提供商（开箱即用的其他家）"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["选择「添加提供方」，可选取 Anthropic、OpenAI 等，填入密钥即可。注意需要",["$","strong",null,{"children":"原生凭据"}],"的提供商：Bedrock（AWS 凭证+区域）、Vertex（ADC 项目）、Azure（api-version）、Codex（OAuth）， 只填 API Key 字段无法完成配置。"]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"pt-2 text-ios-body font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"自定义提供商（网关 / 自建 / 兼容端点）"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["公司网关或任何 OpenAI 兼容端点选「添加自定义提供方」，填：Provider ID（小写，",["$","strong",null,{"children":"永久"}],"， 请求、会话、凭据引用都用它，改不了只能删了重建）、基础 URL、API 协议、API Key，以及至少一个模型。 在「模型目录」点「获取可用模型」会去查 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"GET /models"}],"；没有该接口的服务 就手动输入模型 id。"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"模型模态"}],"：手动录入的模型默认按纯文本对待。视觉模型需要在",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"$$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml"}]," 给该模型加",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"input: [text, image]"}],"；整个路由都支持图片则用",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"defaultInput: [text, image]"}]," 一次设置。"]}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"# settings.yaml 片段：给自定义网关的一个模型开图片输入\nllm-pi-ai:\n  providers:\n    my-gateway:\n      apiKeyEnv: GATEWAY_API_KEY\n      api: openai-completions\n      baseURL: https://gateway.example/v1\n      models:\n        - id: vision-preview\n          input: [text, image]"}]}]]}]]}]
1b:["$","section",null,{"id":"permissions","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"05"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"权限与沙箱"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"沙箱只有三个模式（都只限制文件操作）："}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"read-only             只读：不能改任何文件\nworkspace-write       默认预设：bash 和文件修改仅限当前工作区 + 平台临时目录\ndanger-full-access    不限制：可以改任何路径文件（高危）"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["默认的 ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"workspace-write"}]," 下：读取、网络访问和进程可见性不受限制；写入被 限制在工作区内。Agent 想越权时会走",["$","strong",null,{"children":"审批升权"}],"链："]}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"read-only → workspace-write → danger-full-access"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Web UI 里遇到需要批准的操作会先询问你，批准即按更宽策略重发一次调用。新会话默认 workspace-write；",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"DSH_PERMISSION_MODE"}]," 更换进程级后备值； 设置中的「通用」里存的权限影响后续 Web 会话，不改变已打开的会话。"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["沙箱后端按平台实现：Linux 用 Landlock（含 native/ 下的 landlock-run）或 bubblewrap、 macOS 用 sandbox-exec、Windows 用 ACL restricted-token runner。后端不可用时会",["$","strong",null,{"children":"拒绝执行而不是放开限制"}],"（SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE）。"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["想知道会话实际处于什么模式，看 agent 的系统提示词以外的运行时上下文，或直接查",["$","code",null,{"className":"mx-1 rounded bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[#242830]","children":"dsh --profile web --dump-config"}]," 里的 sandbox 相关行。"]}]]}]]}]
