1f:["$","section",null,{"id":"programmatic","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"09"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"程序化接入（headless / Python SDK）"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"pt-2 text-ios-body font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"headless 一次性任务"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"不依赖浏览器："}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"dsh --profile headless \"run the tests\"\ndsh --profile headless --patch ./extra.cordis.yml \"deploy to staging\""}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"pt-2 text-ios-body font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"Python SDK"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"要求 Python 3.10+，平台限 Linux x64 / Linux arm64 / macOS 14+ arm64；运行时由 pip 包自带，不需要系统装 Node.js："}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"git clone https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git\ncd deepseek-harness\npython -m venv .venv && . .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install deepseek-harness-sdk\n\nexport DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here\n# export DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1   # 走 OpenAI 兼容代理时\n# export DSH_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash\npython examples/jsonrpc-agent/minimal.py   --workspace /abs/path/to/workspace   --session-root /abs/path/to/sessions   --session-id example-001   \"Inspect the repository and fix the failing tests.\""}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"在自己的程序里用同一套 API："}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] p-4 font-mono text-ios-footnote leading-relaxed text-[#242830]","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"from pathlib import Path\nfrom deepseek_harness import DeepSeekHarness\n\nwith DeepSeekHarness(\n    provider=\"deepseek-official\",\n    model=\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\n    max_tokens=49_152,\n    cwd=\"/abs/path/to/workspace\",\n    session_root=\"/abs/path/to/sessions\",\n    cordis=\"examples/jsonrpc-agent/minimal.cordis.yml\",\n) as harness:\n    result = harness.run(\n        \"Inspect the repository and fix the failing tests.\",\n        session_id=\"example-001\",\n    )\nprint(result.final_response)"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"复用同一个 harness 与 session id 会保留该会话的 Bash 进程（工作目录、导出的变量、shell 函数）；独立任务请用新 session id。会话目录会收到 JSONL 日志，包含组装后的模型请求与工具 调用。"}]]}]]}]
20:["$","section",null,{"id":"security","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-ios-2xl bg-[rgba(0,122,255,0.10)] font-mono text-ios-footnote font-semibold text-[#007AFF]","children":"10"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-ios-title2 font-semibold text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]","children":"安全与隐私"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-ios-body leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.62)]","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"凭据只写"}],"：API Key 保存后只保留脱敏描述符，界面与环境变量都不会回显明文。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"遥测默认关闭"}],"：会话数据留在本地。显式设置 DSH_TELEMETRY_MODE=FULL 才会上报， 且随附配置没有脱敏规则——上报内容可能包含消息文本、工具参数和工作区路径，谨慎开启。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"MCP 服务器默认不启用"}],"：每条 server 命令都是 Agent 沙箱之外的可信可执行代码， 需要 patch 层显式启用。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"会话日志是敏感的"}],"：日志里包含模型请求与工具调用，不要提交到公开仓库。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"danger-full-access 只在可信环境用"}],"：沙箱不可用时会拒绝执行而不是放开限制， 别为了省事关掉沙箱。"]}]]}]}]]}]
